  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0 — Email sub-resources, webhook signatures, status rework\n\nNew endpoints:\n- GetEmailMetaAsync — GET /emails/{id}/meta (metadata without body)\n- GetEmailBodyAsync — GET /emails/{id}/body (parsed text/HTML only)\n- GetEmailRawAsync — GET /emails/{id}/raw (full MIME message)\n- GetEmailAttachmentsAsync — GET /emails/{id}/attachments (base64 content)\n\nNew features:\n- WebhookSignatureValidator — HMAC-SHA256 webhook signature verification with timing-safe comparison and replay attack protection\n- EmailStatus constants — all 12 email statuses after the API status rework (accepted, scheduled, delivered, bounced, attempted, failed, rejected, loaded, clicked, suppressed, received, complained)\n- EmailType constants — inbound/outbound email type support\n\nUpdated models:\n- EmailResponse: added Type field (inbound/outbound)\n- ListEmailsRequest: added Type filter\n- TemplateResponse: added TotalVersions field",
